Keiko build patch for Node.js v26.13.1 on a current hosted Windows runner (not a behaviour change).
The Rust standard library of the runner's toolchain imports WaitOnAddress, WakeByAddressSingle and
WakeByAddressAll, which live in synchronization.lib; deps/crates/crates.gyp links only ntdll and
userenv, so mksnapshot fails at link time with "undefined symbol: __declspec(dllimport) WaitOnAddress".
Apply from the Node source root with: git apply -p1 patches/node-26.13.1-win-crates-synchronization.patch

--- a/deps/crates/crates.gyp
+++ b/deps/crates/crates.gyp
@@ -64,7 +64,8 @@
           ['OS=="win"', {
             'libraries': [
               '-lntdll',
-              '-luserenv'
+              '-luserenv',
+              '-lsynchronization'
             ],
           }],
         ],
